# Freecord Cursor Rules
# Main repository guidelines:
# ./AGENTS.md

- All code MUST adhere strictly to 100% Serverless, P2P Mesh, and Local-First architecture.
- NEVER introduce cloud databases (Firebase, Supabase) or central telemetry.
- ALL git commits MUST be in English following Conventional Commits 1.0.0 (e.g., `feat(scope): ...`, `fix(scope): ...`).
- ALL new branches MUST be in English following naming conventions (e.g., `feat/feature-name`, `fix/issue-name`).
- Every code change MUST pass `npm run build` before completion.
- Refer to `AGENTS.md`, `ANALISE_DISCORD_VS_FREECORD.md` and `RELATORIO_BUGS_E_AUDITORIA.md` for detailed guidelines.
